#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Isaac Lab installs Newton by default.** The standard installation runs "
"without Isaac Sim; add Isaac Sim or other optional backends when your "
"workflow needs them. Start with the automatic ``uv`` setup, or choose "
"another installation method below."
msgstr ""
"**Isaac Lab 默认安装 Newton。** 标准安装无需 Isaac Sim 即可运行；工作流有需要时，再添加 Isaac Sim "
"或其他可选后端。可以从自动 ``uv`` 配置开始，或选择下方的其他安装方式。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:27
msgid "Choose an installation path"
msgstr "选择安装路径"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:32
msgid "Automatic setup with uv"
msgstr "使用 uv 自动安装"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:36
msgid ""
"Run with Newton from the Isaac Lab checkout while ``uv`` manages the "
"environment. **Recommended for most users.**"
msgstr "在 Isaac Lab 源码目录中使用 Newton，由 ``uv`` 管理环境。**推荐大多数用户使用。**"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:39
msgid "Manage a uv environment"
msgstr "管理 uv 环境"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:43
msgid ""
"Prepare the environment explicitly with ``uv sync``, with optional Isaac Sim"
" support."
msgstr "通过 ``uv sync`` 显式准备环境，可选择添加 Isaac Sim 支持。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:45 source/isaaclab/installation.rst:299
msgid "Isaac Lab Python package"
msgstr "Isaac Lab Python 软件包"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:49
msgid ""
"Install the released Isaac Lab package as a dependency of your own project."
msgstr "将已发布的 Isaac Lab 软件包作为自己项目的依赖安装。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:51 source/isaaclab/installation.rst:575
msgid "Build Isaac Sim from source"
msgstr "从源码构建 Isaac Sim"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:55
msgid "Build or modify Isaac Sim itself. This is an advanced workflow."
msgstr "构建或修改 Isaac Sim 本身，适用于高级开发需求。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:57 source/isaaclab/installation.rst:612
msgid "Docker containers"
msgstr "Docker 容器"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:61
msgid ""
"Build or run a container with the physics and rendering stack you need."
msgstr "根据所需的物理与渲染组件构建或运行容器。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:63 source/isaaclab/installation.rst:1140
msgid "Cloud workstations"
msgstr "云端工作站"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:67
msgid "Provision a remote GPU workstation on a supported cloud provider."
msgstr "在受支持的云平台上创建远程 GPU 工作站。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:72
msgid "System requirements"
msgstr "系统要求"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:74
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab installs Newton by default, using **NVIDIA Warp** for simulation. "
"The requirements below cover the default Newton and PyTorch training "
"environment; Isaac Sim is an optional addition."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 默认安装 Newton，使用 **NVIDIA Warp** 进行仿真。以下要求针对默认的 Newton 与 PyTorch "
"训练环境，Isaac Sim 属于可选组件。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:81
msgid "Component"
msgstr "组件"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:82
msgid "Requirement"
msgstr "要求"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:83
msgid "Python"
msgstr "Python"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:84
msgid "Python 3.12. The automatic ``uv`` setup manages the environment."
msgstr "Python 3.12。自动 ``uv`` 配置会管理环境。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:85
msgid "Platform"
msgstr "平台"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:86
msgid ""
"Ubuntu 22.04+ on x86_64, Linux aarch64 (including DGX Spark), or Windows 11 "
"on x86_64."
msgstr ""
"x86_64 上的 Ubuntu 22.04+、Linux aarch64（包括 DGX Spark），或 x86_64 上的 Windows 11。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:87
msgid "GPU training"
msgstr "GPU 训练"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:88
msgid ""
"A CUDA-capable NVIDIA GPU supported by the selected Newton solver and "
"PyTorch. The default CUDA 13 stack requires Turing or newer (compute "
"capability 7.5+)."
msgstr ""
"所选 Newton 求解器与 PyTorch 支持的、具备 CUDA 能力的 NVIDIA GPU。默认的 CUDA 13 软件栈要求 Turing "
"或更新架构，计算能力至少为 7.5。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:90
msgid "NVIDIA driver"
msgstr "NVIDIA 驱动"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:91
msgid ""
"``580.65.06`` or newer on Linux; ``580.88`` or newer on Windows. Use a "
"current production driver for your GPU."
msgstr "Linux 至少为 ``580.65.06``，Windows 至少为 ``580.88``。请使用适合该 GPU 的当前生产版驱动。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:93
msgid "Memory"
msgstr "内存"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:94
msgid ""
"RAM and VRAM needs depend on the task, number of parallel environments, and "
"camera workload. Isaac Sim's workstation memory requirements do not apply to"
" a Newton-only installation."
msgstr "RAM 和显存需求取决于任务、并行环境数与相机工作负载。Isaac Sim 的工作站内存要求不适用于仅安装 Newton 的情况。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:97
msgid ""
"This release uses Warp 1.17. Its prebuilt wheels include the CUDA components"
" needed by Warp, so a separate CUDA Toolkit installation is not needed for "
"standard wheel-based use. See `Warp installation "
"<https://nvidia.github.io/warp/v1.17/user_guide/installation.html>`__ and "
"`compatibility "
"<https://nvidia.github.io/warp/v1.17/user_guide/compatibility.html>`__ for "
"its platform and GPU requirements."
msgstr ""
"本版本使用 Warp 1.17，其预编译 wheel 包含所需 CUDA 组件，因此标准的 wheel 安装无需另装 CUDA Toolkit。平台与 "
"GPU 要求见 `Warp 安装 "
"<https://nvidia.github.io/warp/v1.17/user_guide/installation.html>`__ 和 "
"`兼容性说明 "
"<https://nvidia.github.io/warp/v1.17/user_guide/compatibility.html>`__。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:105
msgid ""
"The default environment also installs **PyTorch with CUDA 13.0**, which sets"
" the driver minimum above. Warp 1.17's CUDA 12 wheels alone can run with "
"older drivers; meeting only Warp's minimum is not enough for the default GPU"
" training environment. See the `PyTorch CUDA 13.0 requirements "
"<https://pytorch.org/blog/pytorch-2-12-release-blog/>`__."
msgstr ""
"默认环境还安装 **使用 CUDA 13.0 的 PyTorch**，因此驱动下限如上所述。仅使用 Warp 1.17 的 CUDA 12 wheel "
"可以运行在更旧的驱动上，但只满足 Warp 最低要求，不足以运行默认 GPU 训练环境。参阅 `PyTorch CUDA 13.0 要求 "
"<https://pytorch.org/blog/pytorch-2-12-release-blog/>`__。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:111
msgid "Optional Isaac Sim and rendering"
msgstr "可选的 Isaac Sim 与渲染支持"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:113
msgid ""
"**Isaac Sim:** Install the ``isaacsim`` extra for Isaac Sim 6.2 / PhysX "
"workflows. On Linux, its wheels require GLIBC 2.35+. For x86_64 "
"workstations, plan for at least 32 GB RAM, 16 GB VRAM, and a supported RTX "
"GPU; training and rendering may need more. Check the `Isaac Sim requirements"
" "
"<https://docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com/latest/installation/requirements.html>`__"
" for supported GPUs, tested drivers, and DGX Spark support. Isaac Sim 5.1 "
"and older are unsupported."
msgstr ""
"**Isaac Sim：** 安装 ``isaacsim`` extra，可使用 Isaac Sim 6.2 / PhysX 工作流。Linux "
"wheel 要求 GLIBC 2.35+。x86_64 工作站应至少配备 32 GB RAM、16 GB 显存和受支持的 RTX "
"GPU；训练与渲染可能需要更多资源。受支持 GPU、已测试驱动及 DGX Spark 支持情况，见 `Isaac Sim 要求 "
"<https://docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com/latest/installation/requirements.html>`__。不支持"
" Isaac Sim 5.1 及更早版本。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:118
msgid ""
"**Rendering:** Headless Newton simulation does not require RTX hardware. Add"
" the requirements of your chosen :doc:`renderer "
"</source/concepts/renderers>` or :doc:`visualizer "
"</source/concepts/visualization>` when you need camera images or an "
"interactive view. RTX rendering has its own `GPU and driver requirements "
"<https://docs.omniverse.nvidia.com/materials-and-"
"rendering/latest/common/technical-requirements.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"**渲染：** 无界面的 Newton 仿真不要求 RTX 硬件。需要相机图像或交互视图时，还应满足所选 :doc:`渲染器 "
"</source/concepts/renderers>` 或 :doc:`可视化器 </source/concepts/visualization>`"
" 的要求。RTX 渲染有其自身的 `GPU 与驱动要求 <https://docs.omniverse.nvidia.com/materials-"
"and-rendering/latest/common/technical-requirements.html>`__。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:0
msgid "Linux aarch64 and DGX Spark requirements"
msgstr "Linux aarch64 和 DGX Spark 的要求"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:126
msgid ""
"DGX Spark requires CUDA 13 or newer and the corresponding PyTorch build. "
"Install the build prerequisites before installing Isaac Lab:"
msgstr ""
"DGX Spark 需要 CUDA 13 或更高版本，以及对应的 PyTorch 构建版本。在安装 Isaac Lab 前，先安装构建所需的依赖："

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:134
msgid ""
"SkillGen, XR teleoperation, livestream, Hub Workstation Cache, Cosmos "
"Transfer1, and RLinf are not currently supported or validated on DGX Spark. "
"SkillGen depends on native CUDA/C++ extensions whose toolchain has not been "
"validated on DGX Spark, while XR remains limited by unvalidated encoding "
"performance."
msgstr ""
"目前，SkillGen、XR 遥操作、直播流、Hub Workstation Cache、Cosmos Transfer1 和 RLinf 在 DGX "
"Spark 上尚未得到支持或验证。SkillGen 依赖原生 CUDA/C++ 扩展，其工具链尚未在 DGX Spark 上验证；XR "
"则仍受限于尚未验证的编码性能。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:142
msgid "Automatic setup with uv (recommended)"
msgstr "使用 uv 自动安装（推荐）"

