#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:243
msgid ""
"``uv run`` installs the core dependencies automatically. The ``--extra "
"<name>`` option includes the selected optional integration in the command's "
"environment. Place it before ``isaaclab``; for example, ``--extra ov`` "
"installs both ovphysx and ovrtx backends. Pass a comma-separated list or "
"repeat ``--extra``. No extras conflict, so any combination resolves into one"
" environment. The ``--extra all`` shortcut installs the curated ``ov``, "
"``rl-games``, ``sb3``, ``skrl``, ``rsl-rl``, ``rerun``, and ``viser`` "
"extras. It does not include Isaac Sim or the specialized ``skrl-jax``, "
"``rlinf``, ``mimic``, ``teleop``, ``tetrahedralization``, ``video``, and "
"``leapp`` extras; request them by name:"
msgstr ""
"``uv run`` 自动安装核心依赖。``--extra <name>`` 将选定的可选集成加入该命令的运行环境，应放在 ``isaaclab`` "
"前，例如 ``--extra ov`` 同时安装 ovphysx 和 ovrtx 后端。可以传入逗号分隔的列表，或重复使用 "
"``--extra``。各可选依赖组之间没有冲突，可以组合安装到同一环境。``--extra all`` 安装经过筛选的 ``ov``、``rl-"
"games``、``sb3``、``skrl``、``rsl-rl``、``rerun`` 和 ``viser`` 依赖组，不包含 Isaac "
"Sim，也不包含 ``skrl-"
"jax``、``rlinf``、``mimic``、``teleop``、``tetrahedralization``、``video``、``leapp``"
" 等专用依赖组；需要按名称明确指定："

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:257
msgid "See :ref:`installation-optional-extras` for the available extras."
msgstr "可用的可选依赖组见 :ref:`installation-optional-extras` 。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:259
msgid ""
"``uv run --extra <name> <command>`` syncs the selected extra into the "
"project environment and then runs the command."
msgstr "``uv run --extra <name> <command>`` 会先将选定的可选依赖组同步到项目环境，再运行命令。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:262
msgid ""
"The source checkout selects PyTorch's CUDA 13.0 build on Linux x86_64, Linux"
" aarch64, and Windows. No additional command flags are needed. The aggregate"
" wheel pins the PyTorch versions using registry-compatible metadata. Its "
"published-wheel commands select the CUDA 13.0 build at install time. The "
"wheel supports Python 3.12, matching the source checkout."
msgstr ""
"源码检出方式会在 Linux x86_64、Linux aarch64 和 Windows 上选择 PyTorch 的 CUDA 13.0 "
"构建，无需额外命令参数。聚合 wheel 使用兼容软件包索引的元数据固定 PyTorch 版本；安装已发布 wheel 的命令会在安装时选择 CUDA "
"13.0 构建。该 wheel 支持 Python 3.12，与源码检出方式一致。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:268
msgid ""
"Head over to the :doc:`/source/isaaclab/quickstart`, which starts with your "
"first task and introduces the available commands, RL libraries, backends, "
"and visualizers."
msgstr ""
"接下来阅读 :doc:`/source/isaaclab/quickstart`，从运行第一个任务开始，了解可用命令、强化学习库、后端和可视化器。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:274
msgid "Manage a uv environment explicitly"
msgstr "显式管理 uv 环境"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:276
msgid "To prepare the checkout without launching a workflow, run:"
msgstr "若只需准备源码环境，不启动工作流，请运行："

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:283
msgid ""
"Omit ``--extra isaacsim`` for the default Newton environment. uv downloads "
"the required Python version and manages ``.venv``. To choose another "
"directory, set ``UV_PROJECT_ENVIRONMENT`` before both ``uv sync`` and ``uv "
"run``. Keep the same extras on subsequent commands so uv preserves the "
"integrations you selected."
msgstr ""
"省略 ``--extra isaacsim``，即为默认 Newton 环境。uv 下载所需 Python 版本并管理 "
"``.venv``。如需其他目录，应在 ``uv sync`` 和 ``uv run`` 前都设置 "
"``UV_PROJECT_ENVIRONMENT``。后续命令保持相同的 extra，以便 uv 保留所选集成。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:288
msgid ""
"You can activate this environment for tools that expect ``python`` on PATH:"
msgstr "对于需要从 PATH 查找 ``python`` 的工具，可以激活环境："

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:294
msgid "On Windows Command Prompt, use ``.venv\\Scripts\\activate``."
msgstr "Windows 命令提示符使用 ``.venv\\Scripts\\activate``。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:301
msgid ""
"Use this path when Isaac Lab is a dependency of an external Python project. "
"The released ``isaaclab`` package includes the unified ``train``, ``play``, "
"``zero_agent``, ``random_agent``, ``benchmark``, ``train_multigpu``, "
"``demo``, and ``example`` commands. Downstream projects can register their "
"task package through the ``isaaclab.tasks`` Python package entry-point "
"group; projects created by the template generator configure this "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"如果将 Isaac Lab 作为外部 Python 项目的依赖，请选择这种方式。已发布的 ``isaaclab`` 软件包提供统一的 ``train``"
" 、 ``play`` 、 ``zero_agent`` 、 ``random_agent`` 、 ``benchmark`` 、 "
"``train_multigpu`` 、 ``demo`` 和 ``example`` 命令。下游项目可通过 ``isaaclab.tasks`` "
"Python 软件包入口点组注册自己的任务包；模板生成器创建的项目会自动配置此入口点。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:307
msgid "To create a project built on Isaac Lab, see :ref:`template-generator`."
msgstr "创建基于 Isaac Lab 的项目，请参阅 :ref:`template-generator` 。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:311
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab wheels are published for major releases, not every patch release."
msgstr "Isaac Lab wheel 随主要版本发布，并非每个补丁版本都会发布。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:314
msgid "Installing an unreleased Git revision"
msgstr "安装尚未发布的 Git 版本"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:316
msgid ""
"The aggregate package can also be built directly from an Isaac Lab Git "
"revision. Point uv at the ``tools/wheel_builder`` subdirectory so it uses "
"the same dependency metadata and packaged runtime resources as a released "
"wheel:"
msgstr ""
"也可以直接从 Isaac Lab 的某个 Git 版本构建整合软件包。将 uv 指向 ``tools/wheel_builder`` "
"子目录，即可使用与已发布 wheel 相同的依赖元数据和打包运行时资源："

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:328
msgid ""
"Use a commit hash or release tag for reproducible environments. A branch "
"name is accepted, but updating the lockfile can then select a newer Isaac "
"Lab revision and dependency set."
msgstr "使用提交哈希或发布标签，以保证环境可复现。也可以使用分支名称，但更新锁文件时可能选用更新的 Isaac Lab 提交及依赖集合。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:332
msgid "Installing the published wheel"
msgstr "安装已发布的 wheel"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:334
msgid ""
"Use NVIDIA's package index for the |isaaclab_wheel_version| prerelease. Do "
"not point Isaac Lab at the Git source from the previous workflow when "
"installing the published wheel."
msgstr ""
"请从 NVIDIA 软件包索引安装 |isaaclab_wheel_version| 预发布版本。安装已发布 wheel 时，不要再将 Isaac "
"Lab 指向上一种工作流中的 Git 源码。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:337
msgid ""
"Run the published package directly or install it into a persistent "
"environment. All workflows start with the base ``isaaclab`` package; add "
"optional capabilities only when your project needs them."
msgstr ""
"可以直接运行已发布的软件包，也可以将它安装到持久环境中。所有方式都从基础 ``isaaclab`` 软件包开始，只在项目需要时添加可选功能。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:0
msgid "Direct uvx command"
msgstr "直接使用 uvx 命令"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:351
msgid ""
"This resolves the published wheel from the package index into an isolated "
"environment. It does not require a source checkout, wheel download, or "
"project file."
msgstr "该命令从软件包索引解析已发布的 wheel，并在隔离环境中运行，无需检出源码、手动下载 wheel 或创建项目文件。"

