#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:407
msgid ""
"The project workflow records the dependencies, package indexes, and lockfile"
" for an application you maintain; the commands make those project-file "
"changes, so no manual editing is required. Use ``uvx`` for one-off commands "
"or a standalone environment for exploratory work that needs an activated "
"Python environment. Pass the same index strategy when adding or upgrading "
"dependencies in the project."
msgstr ""
"对于长期维护的应用，项目工作流会记录依赖、软件包索引和锁文件。下列命令会完成这些项目文件的修改，无需手动编辑。临时运行命令时可使用 "
"``uvx``；探索性工作如果需要激活 Python 环境，则可使用独立环境。在项目中添加或升级依赖时，应传入相同的索引策略。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:415
