"volumes, including logs and caches. Older versions deleted volumes on every "
"stop. Pass ``--remove-volumes`` to delete them explicitly; this is project-"
"wide cleanup, requires the selected container to exist, and refuses to run "
"while other project containers remain (including stopped ones). Copy results"
" and remove those containers without volume cleanup first (``docker rm "
"<name>`` for stopped containers). See :ref:`docker-images` for the one-time "
"migration from root-owned volumes. The image remains. To remove it after "
"stopping, run ``docker image rm isaac-lab-base``; the next ``start`` "
"rebuilds it. See `Docker pruning <https://docs.docker.com/engine/manage-"
"resources/pruning/>`__ for other cleanup options."
msgstr ""
"日志现在保存在主机的 ``docker/artifacts/logs/docker_tutorial/log.txt``。``stop`` "
"删除容器，但保留其命名卷，包括日志和缓存；旧版每次停止都会删除卷。显式传入 ``--remove-volumes`` "
"才会删除卷，这是项目范围的清理操作，要求所选容器仍存在，且其他项目容器均已移除，包括已停止的容器。请先复制结果，并在不清理卷的情况下移除其他容器，已停止容器使用"
" ``docker rm <name>``。从 root 所有的卷迁移的一次性步骤见 :ref:`docker-"
"images`。镜像仍会保留，停止后可通过 ``docker image rm isaac-lab-base`` 删除，下次 ``start`` "
"会重新构建。其他清理方式见 `Docker 清理 <https://docs.docker.com/engine/manage-"
"resources/pruning/>`__。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:0
msgid "Code for log_time.py"
msgstr "log_time.py 的代码"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:736
msgid ""
"The image copies the repository to ``/workspace/isaaclab`` at build time, so"
" edits made after the build are not picked up automatically. To keep the "
"development loop fast, the compose file bind-mounts ``source``, ``scripts``,"
" ``apps``, ``docs``, and ``tools`` from the host, so changes to those "
"directories appear inside the container immediately. Everything else "
"requires a rebuild."
msgstr ""
"镜像在构建时将仓库复制到 ``/workspace/isaaclab``，构建后的修改不会自动纳入。为加快开发迭代，Compose 文件将主机的 "
"``source``、``scripts``、``apps``、``docs`` 和 ``tools`` "
"绑定挂载到容器，因此这些目录的变更立即可见，其他内容仍需重新构建。"

