#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:805
msgid "What persists between runs"
msgstr "运行之间保留的内容"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:807
msgid ""
"The compose file declares named volumes for Isaac Sim caches, logs, and your"
" own data. They remain available across ``container.py stop`` calls. "
"Explicit ``container.py stop --remove-volumes`` deletes them project-wide. "
"Run ``container.py copy`` before volume cleanup to preserve your results on "
"the host."
msgstr ""
"Compose 文件为 Isaac Sim 缓存、日志及用户数据声明命名卷，执行 ``container.py stop`` 后仍可使用。显式执行 "
"``container.py stop --remove-volumes`` 会在项目范围内删除这些卷。清理前请运行 ``container.py "
"copy``，将结果保存到主机。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:812
msgid ""
"``container.py copy`` extracts the three volumes you are most likely to want"
" on the host -- ``logs``, ``data_storage``, and ``docs/_build`` -- into "
"``docker/artifacts``. For anything else, use ``docker cp``, for example "
"``docker cp isaac-lab-base:/workspace/isaaclab/logs .``."
msgstr ""
"``container.py copy`` 将最常需要的三个卷——``logs`` 、 ``data_storage`` 和 "
"``docs/_build``——提取到宿主机 ``docker/artifacts`` 。其他内容使用 ``docker cp`` ，例如 "
"``docker cp isaac-lab-base:/workspace/isaaclab/logs .`` 。"

