#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:880
msgid "Display forwarding with X11"
msgstr "通过 X11 转发显示"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:882
msgid ""
"X11 forwarding lets GUI applications started inside the container display on"
" the host. The first ``start`` asks whether to enable it and records the "
"answer in ``docker/.container.cfg``. To change it later, set "
"``X11_FORWARDING_ENABLED`` to ``0`` or ``1`` in that file and run ``start`` "
"again -- the rebuild is what applies the change."
msgstr ""
"X11 转发使容器内启动的图形应用显示在宿主机上。首次 ``start`` 会询问是否启用，并将答案记录在 "
"``docker/.container.cfg`` 。以后如需修改，将该文件的 ``X11_FORWARDING_ENABLED`` 设为 ``0`` "
"或 ``1`` ，再运行 ``start`` ；修改在重新构建时生效。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:894
msgid "Container images"
msgstr "容器镜像"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:896
msgid ""
"Each :ref:`profile <deployment-docker>` builds a different image. They "
"differ in what simulation and rendering stack they carry, which decides how "
"large they are and what they can run. This page describes the images "
"themselves; to build or run one, name its profile in the :ref:`container "
"lifecycle <container-lifecycle>`."
msgstr ""
"每种 :ref:`配置 <deployment-docker>` "
"构建不同镜像。它们所包含的仿真与渲染栈不同，决定镜像大小及可运行内容。本页介绍镜像本身；构建或运行时，在 :ref:`容器生命周期 "
"<container-lifecycle>` 中指定其配置名称。"

