msgstr "构建镜像"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:921
msgid ""
"Every image builds with the same command; only the profile name changes. "
"From the repository root, build the image for a profile from the table "
"above, for example ``kitless``:"
msgstr "所有镜像使用相同的构建命令，只需更改配置名称。在仓库根目录，选择上表中的配置构建镜像，例如 ``kitless``："

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:928
msgid ""
"``./docker/container.py start kitless`` also builds the image before "
"starting the container. Without Compose, build the profile's Dockerfile "
"directly; it uses the same default paths:"
msgstr ""
"``./docker/container.py start kitless`` 也会在启动容器前构建镜像。不使用 Compose "
"时，可以直接构建对应配置的 Dockerfile，其默认路径相同："

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:935
msgid ""
"Release images are also published pre-built, so building is optional; see "
":ref:`docker-ngc-images`."
msgstr "发布版本也提供预构建镜像，可以直接使用，无需自行构建，见 :ref:`docker-ngc-images` 。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:938
msgid "Base image"
msgstr "基础镜像"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:940
msgid ""
"``Dockerfile.base`` overlays Isaac Lab's dependencies onto the Isaac Sim "
"container, so it inherits Kit, RTX rendering, and the Isaac Sim asset "
"pipeline. The Isaac Sim version it builds against is set by "
"``ISAACSIM_VERSION`` in ``.env.base``; the other variables in that file "
"control paths inside the container."
msgstr ""
"``Dockerfile.base`` 在 Isaac Sim 容器上添加 Isaac Lab 依赖，因此继承 Kit、RTX 渲染和 Isaac "
"Sim 资产管线。构建所用 Isaac Sim 版本由 ``.env.base`` 中的 ``ISAACSIM_VERSION`` "
"指定；该文件的其他变量控制容器内路径。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:945
msgid ""
"Dependencies are installed from ``uv.lock`` with frozen resolution. To "
"update the development container after pulling repository changes, rebuild "
"it and recreate the service:"
msgstr "依赖通过 ``uv.lock`` 冻结解析后安装。拉取仓库变更后，如需更新开发容器，请重新构建并重建服务："

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:954
msgid ""
"Stopping now preserves named volumes; older versions deleted them on every "
"stop. Compose caches, logs, and data use named volumes, whose existing "
"ownership is unchanged by rebuilding. For a one-time upgrade from a root-run"
" image, copy any results you need, stop other profiles without ``--remove-"
"volumes`` (use ``docker rm <name>`` for already-stopped containers), then "
"run ``./docker/container.py stop base --remove-volumes`` before rebuilding "
"and starting base. This deletes the project's caches, logs, and data so new "
"volumes inherit uid/gid 1000 ownership. Cleanup requires the selected "
"container to still exist and refuses to run while another container remains "
"in the Compose project."
msgstr ""
"现在停止容器会保留命名卷，旧版则每次都删除。Compose 缓存、日志和数据使用命名卷，其已有所有权不会因重新构建而改变。从 root "
"运行的镜像升级时，应先复制所需结果，在不使用 ``--remove-volumes`` 的情况下停止其他配置，已停止容器使用 ``docker rm "
"<name>``；再在重新构建和启动 base 前，执行一次 ``./docker/container.py stop base --remove-"
"volumes``。这会删除项目的缓存、日志和数据，使新卷继承 uid/gid 1000 的所有权。清理要求所选容器仍存在，且 Compose "
"项目中没有其他容器。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:963
msgid ""
"If the selected container was already removed, start it again before "
"requesting cleanup. For custom host bind-mounted caches, fix ownership on "
"the host to uid/gid 1000 instead."
msgstr "若所选容器已删除，需先重新启动它，再请求清理。对于自定义的主机绑定挂载缓存，应直接在主机上将所有权修正为 uid/gid 1000。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:966
msgid ""
"With X11 forwarding enabled, launch the standalone Isaac Sim GUI from its "
"installation directory:"
msgstr "启用 X11 转发后，从安装目录启动独立 Isaac Sim GUI："

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:973
msgid ""
"The image redirects shared Python packages, including the direct "
"``omni.warp.core`` package, to the locked environment. Missing "
"``packaging/__init__.py`` or ``warp/_src/apic/__init__.py`` errors indicate "
"broken shared package files; recreating a container from a newly built image"
" restores the package tree. An installer error about a whole-namespace "
"NVIDIA symlink likewise requires restoring a clean Isaac Sim installation or"
" rebuilding the image before retrying; removing the link alone does not "
"restore Kit's CUDA 12 libraries. Cache-permission errors require the named-"
"volume migration above or fixing ownership on custom host bind mounts."
msgstr ""
"镜像将共用 Python 包，包括直接的 ``omni.warp.core`` 包，重定向到锁定环境。缺少 "
"``packaging/__init__.py`` 或 ``warp/_src/apic/__init__.py`` "
"表示共享包文件损坏，使用新构建镜像重建容器可恢复包目录。若安装器报告 NVIDIA 整个命名空间的符号链接错误，也需先恢复干净的 Isaac Sim "
"安装或重建镜像，再重试；仅删除链接无法恢复 Kit 的 CUDA 12 库。缓存权限错误则需执行上方的命名卷迁移，或修正自定义主机绑定挂载的所有权。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:982
msgid "Kit-less image"
msgstr "不依赖 Kit 的镜像"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:984
msgid ""
"The kit-less image drops Isaac Sim entirely and builds on Ubuntu 24.04 with "
"Python 3.12. It carries Newton physics, OVPhysX physics, OVRTX rendering, "
"and the four core RL frameworks: RL Games, RSL-RL, Stable-Baselines3, and "
"SKRL. The ``newton_gl``, ``newton_rtx``, ``viser``, and ``rerun`` "
"visualizers are included. Use ``--viz newton_gl`` for local visualization "
"with a display available in the container. ``--viz newton_gl`` selects the "
"OpenGL rasterizer; ``--viz newton_rtx`` selects the OVRTX path tracer. Both "
"can render offscreen without Isaac Sim. To open their windows from a direct "
"``docker run``, run ``xhost +local:`` on the host and add ``-e DISPLAY`` and"
" ``-v /tmp/.X11-unix:/tmp/.X11-unix:rw`` to the command below. The "
"deprecated ``--viz newton`` alias selects GL; it does not choose between GL "
"and RTX automatically."
msgstr ""
"不依赖 Kit 的镜像完全移除了 Isaac Sim，基于 Ubuntu 24.04 和 Python 3.12，包含 Newton "
"物理、OVPhysX 物理、OVRTX 渲染，以及 RL Games、RSL-RL、Stable-Baselines3、SKRL "
"四个核心强化学习框架。镜像内置 ``newton_gl``、``newton_rtx``、``viser`` 和 ``rerun`` "
"可视化器。容器能够访问显示器时，可用 ``--viz newton_gl`` 进行本地可视化。``--viz newton_gl`` 选择 OpenGL"
" 光栅化器，``--viz newton_rtx`` 选择 OVRTX 路径追踪器，两者都可在没有 Isaac Sim 的情况下离屏渲染。直接使用 "
"``docker run`` 时，要打开它们的窗口，需在宿主机运行 ``xhost +local:``，并在下方命令中添加 ``-e DISPLAY``"
" 和 ``-v /tmp/.X11-unix:/tmp/.X11-unix:rw``。已弃用的 ``--viz newton`` 别名选择 "
"GL，不会自动在 GL 与 RTX 之间切换。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:994
msgid ""
"Rendering needs NVIDIA graphics driver capabilities in addition to compute. "
"For direct ``docker run`` commands, pass ``--gpus all -e "
"NVIDIA_DRIVER_CAPABILITIES=all``. The NVIDIA Container Toolkit exposes the "
"host driver; avoid mounting a second copy of its Vulkan ICD. If multiple "
"drivers are discovered, select the NVIDIA ICD available inside the container"
" with ``VK_DRIVER_FILES`` (for example, "
"``/etc/vulkan/icd.d/nvidia_icd.json``)."
msgstr ""
"除计算能力外，渲染还需要 NVIDIA 图形驱动能力。直接使用 ``docker run`` 时，传入 ``--gpus all -e "
"NVIDIA_DRIVER_CAPABILITIES=all`` 。NVIDIA Container Toolkit 会提供宿主机驱动，不要再挂载一份 "
"Vulkan ICD。如果发现多个驱动，通过 ``VK_DRIVER_FILES`` 选择容器内可用的 NVIDIA ICD，例如 "
"``/etc/vulkan/icd.d/nvidia_icd.json`` 。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:1000
msgid ""
"No visualizer is selected by default, so training runs headless unless you "
"ask for one. The ``kit`` visualizer is the exception: it comes from "
"Omniverse Kit, which this image does not contain."
msgstr ""
"默认不选择可视化器，因此除非显式请求，训练以无界面模式运行。 ``kit`` 可视化器不可用，因为它来自本镜像未包含的 Omniverse Kit。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:1004
msgid ""
"Unlike the base image, it bind-mounts ``apps`` in addition to ``source``, "
"``scripts``, ``tools``, and ``docs``, and it keeps a uv cache and a Warp "
"cache of its own."
msgstr ""
"与基础镜像不同，它在 ``source``、``scripts``、``tools`` 和 ``docs`` 之外，还绑定挂载 "
"``apps``，并使用独立的 uv 和 Warp 缓存。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:1007
msgid ""
"You do not have to build it locally. It is published alongside each Isaac "
"Lab release in the same registry repository, distinguished by a ``-kitless``"
" tag suffix:"
msgstr "无需在本地构建。它随每个 Isaac Lab 版本发布在同一镜像仓库，用 ``-kitless`` 标签后缀区分："

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:1014
msgid ""
"Running it directly, outside the Compose workflow, is a convenient way to "
"verify the image and your NVIDIA Container Toolkit setup. ``--interactive`` "
"and ``--tty`` keep the container's shell alive so that several commands can "
"share it. The ``isaac-lab-kitless-logs`` named volume keeps checkpoints "
"after the container is removed:"
msgstr ""
"脱离 Compose 工作流程直接运行镜像，便于验证镜像和 NVIDIA Container Toolkit 配置。``--interactive`` "
"和 ``--tty`` 会保持容器 shell 运行，以便多条命令共用同一个容器。``isaac-lab-kitless-logs`` "
"命名卷可在容器删除后保留检查点："

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:1030
msgid "Replay in a browser with:"
msgstr "通过以下命令在浏览器中回放："

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:1038
msgid ""
"Viser is reachable through the host network without forwarding a desktop "
"display. Stop playback with ``Ctrl+C`` without stopping the container. Copy "
"the logs to the host with ``docker cp isaac-lab-"
"kitless:/workspace/isaaclab/logs ./logs``."
msgstr ""
"Viser 可通过宿主机网络访问，无需转发桌面显示。按 ``Ctrl+C`` 可停止回放而不停止容器。用 ``docker cp isaac-lab-"
"kitless:/workspace/isaaclab/logs ./logs`` 将日志复制到宿主机。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:1042
msgid ""
"Check which architectures a tag publishes with ``docker buildx imagetools "
"inspect <image:tag>`` before choosing a host."
msgstr ""
"选择宿主机前，使用 ``docker buildx imagetools inspect <image:tag>`` 检查该标签发布了哪些架构的镜像。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:1048
msgid "Pre-built image from NGC"
msgstr "NGC 预构建镜像"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:1050
msgid ""
"A minimal pre-built container carries a small set of Isaac Sim and Omniverse"
" dependencies with Isaac Lab already built in, under "
"``/workspace/isaaclab``. The example below runs without a forwarded desktop "
"display. Choose the image profile for the physics and rendering stack you "
"need, and configure graphics access separately when rendering."
msgstr ""
"精简的预构建容器包含少量 Isaac Sim 和 Omniverse 依赖，并已在 ``/workspace/isaaclab`` 中内置 Isaac "
"Lab。以下示例无需转发桌面显示。根据所需物理与渲染栈选择镜像配置，渲染时另行配置图形访问。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:1057
msgid ""
"Use an explicit published version tag for reproducible runs. The examples "
"below use ``3.0.0-rc1``; the corresponding kit-less image uses "
"``3.0.0-rc1-kitless``."
msgstr ""
"使用明确的已发布版本标签，以便复现运行。下例使用 ``3.0.0-rc1`` ，对应的不依赖 Kit 的镜像标签为 "
"``3.0.0-rc1-kitless`` 。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:1062
msgid ""
"Images from 3.0.0-beta2 onward run as a **non-root** user, so those bind-"
"mount directories must be writable by uid/gid 1000. Docker creates any "
"missing one as ``root``, which the runtime user cannot write to, producing "
"errors such as ``PermissionError: [Errno 13] Permission denied: "
"'/root/.local/share/ov/data/exts'``. Create them first:"
msgstr ""
"从 3.0.0-beta2 开始，镜像以 **非 root** 用户运行，因此绑定挂载目录必须允许 uid/gid 1000 写入。Docker 会以 "
"``root`` 创建不存在的目录，运行时用户无法写入，可能出现 ``PermissionError: [Errno 13] Permission "
"denied: '/root/.local/share/ov/data/exts'`` 等错误。应先创建目录："

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:1073
msgid ""
"Because it is run outside Compose, the Isaac Sim cache directories have to "
"be mounted by hand, otherwise every start recompiles shaders:"
msgstr "由于在 Compose 之外运行，需手动挂载 Isaac Sim 缓存目录，否则每次启动都重新编译着色器："

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:1090
msgid ""
"The command above opens no windows: without a display, ``--viz kit``, "
"``--viz newton_gl``, and ``--viz newton_rtx`` run headless. The ``viser`` "
"and ``rerun`` visualizers serve a web page instead and need no display. To "
"enable rendering through X11 forwarding, let local clients use the host X "
"server and pass the display into the container:"
msgstr ""
"上面的命令不会打开窗口：没有显示器时，``--viz kit``、``--viz newton_gl`` 和 ``--viz newton_rtx`` "
"均以无界面方式运行。``viser`` 和 ``rerun`` 则提供网页，无需显示器。要通过 X11 转发启用窗口显示，请允许本地客户端使用宿主机 X"
" 服务器，并将显示配置传入容器："

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:1113
msgid ""
"``xhost +local:`` lets every local client use your display, not only the "
"container; run ``xhost -local:`` on the host to revoke it when you are done."
" ``MUJOCO_GL=disable`` is needed by the Newton viewers in images released "
"before it was set in the image: those inherit ``MUJOCO_GL=egl``, which fails"
" the windowed viewer with ``Attempt to retrieve context when no valid "
"context``. The Compose workflow sets up X11 forwarding for you; see "
":ref:`deployment-docker`. Follow the graphics-driver requirements above for "
"GL or RTX."
msgstr ""
"``xhost +local:`` 允许所有本地客户端使用显示器，范围并不只限于容器；用完后请在宿主机运行 ``xhost -local:`` "
"撤销权限。较早发布的镜像尚未在镜像内设置 ``MUJOCO_GL=disable``，Newton 查看器需要显式添加该变量；这些旧镜像继承的 "
"``MUJOCO_GL=egl`` 会使窗口查看器报 ``Attempt to retrieve context when no valid "
"context``。Compose 工作流会自动设置 X11 转发，见 :ref:`deployment-docker` 。GL 和 RTX "
"的图形驱动要求见上文。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:1121
msgid "Runtime user"
msgstr "运行时用户"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:1123
msgid ""
"The base, cuRobo, and kit-less images all run as a non-root user with "
"uid/gid 1000. When running one of these images directly with ``docker run``,"
" keep that default user instead of passing ``--user``, so that the runtime "
"home and cache directories stay writable. Named volumes inherit the image's "
"ownership; make host bind mounts writable with ``sudo chown -R 1000:1000 "
"<directory>``."
msgstr ""
"基础、cuRobo 和无 Kit 镜像均以 uid/gid 1000 的非 root 用户运行。直接使用 ``docker run`` "
"时，应保留此默认用户，不传入 ``--user``，以便运行时主目录与缓存目录保持可写。命名卷继承镜像所有权；主机绑定挂载可用 ``sudo chown"
" -R 1000:1000 <directory>`` 调整为可写。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:1129
msgid "Python interpreter"
msgstr "Python 解释器"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:1131
msgid ""
"Every image installs from ``uv.lock`` into a Python 3.12 virtual environment"
" at ``/opt/isaaclab-venv``. On the Isaac Sim-based images the environment is"
" built on Isaac Sim's own interpreter, and Isaac Sim itself stays outside "
"it, reached through the ``_isaac_sim`` symlink; ``uv run isaaclab`` puts it "
"on the path. In either case ``python`` on the container's ``PATH`` resolves "
"to the right one, so scripts are run the same way regardless of image."
msgstr ""
"所有镜像均从 ``uv.lock`` 安装依赖，使用位于 ``/opt/isaaclab-venv`` 的 Python 3.12 虚拟环境。基于 "
"Isaac Sim 的镜像使用 Isaac Sim 自带解释器创建环境，Isaac Sim 本体保留在环境外，通过 ``_isaac_sim`` "
"符号链接访问；``uv run isaaclab`` 将其加入路径。无论哪种镜像，容器 ``PATH`` 上的 ``python`` "
"都指向正确解释器，因此脚本运行方式相同。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:1142
msgid ""
"Isaac Automator provisions GPU workstations on AWS, GCP, Azure, and Alibaba "
"Cloud. Install Docker, then clone and build Isaac Automator:"
msgstr ""
"Isaac Automator 可在 AWS、GCP、Azure 和阿里云上创建 GPU 工作站。先安装 Docker，再克隆并构建 Isaac "
"Automator："

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:1152
msgid ""
"Replace ``deploy-aws`` with ``deploy-gcp``, ``deploy-azure``, or ``deploy-"
"alicloud``. Use ``--isaaclab`` and ``--isaacsim`` to select Git revisions. "
"Connection details for SSH, noVNC, and NoMachine are stored in "
"``state/<deployment-name>/info.txt``."
msgstr ""
"根据云平台，将 ``deploy-aws`` 替换为 ``deploy-gcp`` 、 ``deploy-azure`` 或 ``deploy-"
"alicloud`` 。通过 ``--isaaclab`` 和 ``--isaacsim`` 选择 Git 版本。SSH、noVNC 和 "
"NoMachine 的连接信息保存在 ``state/<deployment-name>/info.txt`` 中。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:1156
msgid "Manage the workstation from the Automator container:"
msgstr "在 Automator 容器中管理工作站："

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:1166
msgid ""
"Preserve the ``state`` directory because it contains the deployment "
"metadata."
msgstr "请保留 ``state`` 目录，其中包含部署元数据。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:1168
msgid ""
"See :ref:`docker-cloud-cloud` for credentials, provider options, connection "
"methods, data transfer, and the complete workstation lifecycle."
msgstr "凭据、云平台选项、连接方式、数据传输及完整的工作站生命周期说明见 :ref:`docker-cloud-cloud` 。"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:1172
msgid "Next steps"
msgstr "后续步骤"

#: source/isaaclab/installation.rst:1174
msgid ""
"Continue with the :doc:`quickstart </source/isaaclab/quickstart>` to run a "
"task and train a policy. For asset caching, Nucleus migration, and regional "
"asset services, see :doc:`/source/how-to/manage_asset_downloads`. For setup,"
" launch, and performance problems, use the :doc:`troubleshooting reference "
"</source/refs/troubleshooting>`."
msgstr ""
"继续阅读 :doc:`快速入门 </source/isaaclab/quickstart>`，运行任务并训练策略。资产缓存、Nucleus "
"迁移和区域资产服务见 :doc:`/source/how-to/manage_asset_downloads`；安装、启动及性能问题见 "
":doc:`故障排查参考 </source/refs/troubleshooting>`。"
